WEBVTT

21:00.786 --> 21:03.205
Oh, he came inquiring after a book.

21:03.330 --> 21:06.583
A book? What book?

21:06.708 --> 21:11.046
Oh, I fear it would be
of little interest to you, my lord.

21:11.171 --> 21:13.632
A... A ponderous tome.

21:13.757 --> 21:17.261
No, I'd like to read it.

21:19.763 --> 21:22.641
The Lineages and Histories

21:22.766 --> 21:25.936
of the Great Houses
of the Seven Kingdoms,

21:26.061 --> 21:29.064
with descriptions
of many high lords

21:29.189 --> 21:32.192
and noble ladies
